    <sectiondef kind="define">
      <memberdef kind="define" id="_pass_plugin_8h_1a76a304109af54526e3d2a471ac22885b" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>LLVM_PLUGIN_API_VERSION</name>
        <initializer>1</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>\macro LLVM_PLUGIN_API_VERSION Identifies the API version understood by this plugin. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>When a plugin is loaded, the driver will check it&apos;s supported plugin version against that of the plugin. A mismatch is an error. The supported version will be incremented for ABI-breaking changes to the <computeroutput>PassPluginLibraryInfo</computeroutput> struct, i.e. when callbacks are added, removed, or reordered. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
